  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase II of PEUMP - SPC and FFA - Sustainable Fisheries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This action structured around specific objectives (SOs): &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;strengthened ocean governance ; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;enhance capacities in oceanic fisheries including combating IUU and improving sustainable fisheries value chains&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;strengthening community-based, inclusive, sustainable, and climate-resilient management of the coastal blue economy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Enhance marine and coastal ecosystem resilience in the context of climate change&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Increase the regional and national availability of skilled professionals in ocean, climate adaption and biodiversity related fields&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Together, these objectives provide a coherent framework for advancing climate-resilient, environmentally sustainable and socially inclusive development across the Pacific.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
